          "text": "Friend, this is Micah the Moreshite, a prophet carrying the word of the LORD about Samaria and Jerusalem (Micah 1:1). Now he cries 'Woe' to people who plot evil on their beds. Most of us lie awake replaying something awkward we said in a meeting, but these folks lie awake drafting a SCHEME.",
